      ],
      "explanation": "The vertex is at the origin. To its right, the larger \\(x\\) is, the larger its square is.",
      "id": "parabola-properties",
      "sourceRef": "cn-math/cnm_h032_q4#parabola-properties",
      "title": "Use the parabola's properties"
